These files are official Unity-built AssetBundle/SerializedFile samples
used as reference fixtures for differential parser tests. This project is
a Unity-dependent project (it reads and writes Unity binary formats).
oracle.json was generated locally with UnityPy 1.25.4 from these files
and records their node lists and object inventories as test expectations.
